  "worked_solution": "The complement of $A,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{A},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $A.$\n\nThe universal set $U$ consists of the integers from $-8$ through $8,$ while the set $A$ consists of the odd numbers from  $-7$ through $7.$\n\nSo, the only elements of $U$ that are not in $A$ are the even numbers from $-8$ through $8.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $A$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{A}={-8,-6,-4,\u2026,8}.\n$$",
